message: "If you use or adapt these materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Reproducible and Open Science (CBIO7501): open workshop materials"
abstract: >-
  Hands-on lessons on reproducible and open computational research (project
  organization, data management, Quarto, Jupyter, Git, Pixi, containers,
  Snakemake, Nextflow, documentation and publishing), built around one
  variant-calling project on the E. coli Long-Term Evolution Experiment.
type: software
